  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposal contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and numbered Noise Impact Assessment (Review of Refusal), Air Quality Assessment, Design Statement, Marketing Report, Updated Marketing Letter, 131-A3-1000, 131-A1-001-, 131-A1-002-, 131-A1-003-, 131-A1-004-, 131-A1-007-, Received 25 January 2013, 131-A1-006A, 131-A1-008A, Marketing Letter, Received 21 March 2013, 131-A1-005C, Received 22 March 2013and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - The use hereby permitted shall not be occupied until the recommendation made in the Noise Impact Assessment (Review Report) have been implemented in full. The recommendations shall be thereafter permanently maintained.",
    "Condition : 5 - The use hereby permitted shall not be occupied until the recommendations made in the Air Quality Assessment, (such as AAC Swiftpack with Nitrosorb Media, compatible with Mechanical Ventilation Heat Recovery Unit) have been implemented in full. The filter system shall make provision for the removal of NOx and NO2 as part of the mechanical ventilation system. The recommendations shall be thereafter permanently maintained. The ventilation unit shall be maintained as necessary.",
    "Condition : 6 - The rating level of any noise generated by plant & equipment as part of the development shall be at least 10 dB below the pre-existing background level as determined by BS4142: 1997-\"Method of rating industrial noise affecting mixed residential and industrial areas\".",
    "Condition : 7 - The areas allocated for vehicle parking, loading and unloading, circulation and manoeuvring on the approved plan (131-a1-005C, Received 22 March 2013) shall only be used for the said purpose and not for any other purposes.",
    "Condition : 8 - The window formed in the eastern elevation at first floor level within the bedroom of Apartment 1 shall be obscure glazed to a height of 1.5m from the finished floor level."
  ],
